# Application stack and practices

This project’s **declared** dependency ranges define the stack below. Prefer patterns documented for these major versions; when in doubt, check the official upgrade guides before adopting APIs from older tutorials.

## Stack overview

| Layer | Packages / runtime | Role |
|-------|---------------------|------|
| Runtime | PHP `^8.4` | Server language |
| Backend framework | `laravel/framework` `^13.0` | HTTP, queues, ORM, config |
| Full-stack bridge | `inertiajs/inertia-laravel` `^3.0` + `@inertiajs/react` `^3.x` | SPA without a separate API for page navigations |
| Frontend | `react` / `react-dom` `^19.x` | UI components (JSX) |
| Toasts / feedback | `sonner` | Mensajes transitorios al usuario (ver [user-feedback-sonner.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/user-feedback-sonner.mdc)) |
| Build | `vite` `^8.x`, `laravel-vite-plugin` `^3.x`, `@vitejs/plugin-react` `^6.x` | Bundling and HMR |
| CSS | `tailwindcss` `^4.x`, `@tailwindcss/vite` `^4.x` | Utility-first styles via Vite |
| OAuth2 API | `laravel/passport` `^13.x` | OAuth2 server (clients, tokens) |
| First-party API / SPA auth | `laravel/sanctum` `^4.x` | SPA session auth, simple API tokens |
| Social login | `laravel/socialite` `^5.x` | OAuth with external providers |
| Authorization (roles/permissions) | `spatie/laravel-permission` `^7.x` | RBAC in PHP |
| Dev / quality | `laravel/telescope` `^5.x`, `barryvdh/laravel-debugbar` `^4.x`, `laravel/pint` `^1.x`, `phpunit/phpunit` `^12.x`, `laravel/pail` `^1.x` | Debugging, style, tests, log tailing |

Related layout: [project-structure.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/project-structure.mdc).

